# Calastone Pulse — Environment Variables (DOCUMENTATION ONLY)
# ============================================================
# Do NOT put a live key in this tracked file.
#
# Preferred (production / preview):
#   Vercel → Project Settings → Environment Variables
#   Name:  ANTHROPIC_API_KEY
#   Value: sk-ant-...
#   Then redeploy so /api/claude can read it server-side.
#
# Preferred (local):
#   1. Copy this file to .env.local (gitignored)
#   2. Set ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=sk-ant-...
#   3. Run: npm run dev
#   Market Research: http://127.0.0.1:4173/tools/market-research/
#
# Optional static fallback (file:// / plain static server):
#   1. Copy config.example.js → config.js
#   2. Paste the same key into config.js
#
# DO NOT commit config.js or .env.local.
# Rotate keys at: https://console.anthropic.com

ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=PASTE-YOUR-KEY-HERE
CLAUDE_MODEL=claude-sonnet-4-6
